<rml>
<head>
    <title>DragonBoard Welcome Tutorial</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="welcome.rcss" />
</head>
<body>
    <div id="welcome-app">
        <button id="welcome-close" class="welcome-close"><span>X</span></button>

        <section id="welcome-page-1" class="welcome-page welcome-image-page welcome-page-one active">
            <div class="welcome-copy welcome-title"><span>Welcome to DragonBoard</span></div>
            <button id="welcome-next-1" class="welcome-next"><span>Next</span></button>
        </section>

        <section id="welcome-page-2" class="welcome-page welcome-image-page welcome-page-two">
            <div id="welcome-grab-instruction" class="welcome-copy welcome-card welcome-instruction">
                <span>Place the pointer on this screen, <span class="welcome-grab-emphasis">hold the grab button</span> for 1 second, then drag this screen over your DragonBoard.</span>
            </div>
            <div id="welcome-grab-result" class="welcome-copy welcome-card welcome-result">
                <span>You'll use this to move pinned items, adjust items in the inventory, and change the position of the buttons.</span>
            </div>
            <div id="welcome-scale-instruction" class="welcome-copy welcome-card welcome-scale-instruction">
                <span>Use both grips to scale the items. Move your hands apart to make them larger, and bring them closer together to make them smaller.</span>
            </div>
            <button id="welcome-next-2" class="welcome-next disabled"><span>Next</span></button>
        </section>

        <section id="welcome-page-3" class="welcome-page welcome-image-page welcome-page-three">
            <div class="welcome-copy welcome-card welcome-instruction welcome-inventory-copy">
                <span>You can use either the pointer or finger touch. Try opening the inventory by pressing the trigger or touching this button.</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div id="vr-cursor"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
